1. Navigation Bar using Flexbox Spacing
HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar">
    <a href="#">Home</a>
    <a href="#">About</a>
    <a href="#">Services</a>
    <a href="#">Contact</a>
</nav>

</body>
</html>


CSS
.navbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-evenly;
    background-color: black;
    padding: 15px;
}

.navbar a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 18px;
}


2. Center an Image using Flexbox
HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <img src="image.jpg" alt="Image">
</div>

</body>
</html>
CSS
.container {
    width: 500px;
    height: 300px;
    border: 2px solid black;

    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
}

.container img {
    width: 150px;
}
3. Three Boxes (Two Fixed, One Flexible)
HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="box-container">
    <div class="box fixed">Box 1</div>
    <div class="box grow">Box 2</div>
    <div class="box fixed">Box 3</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
CSS
.box-container {
    display: flex;
    border: 2px solid black;
}

.fixed {
    width: 100px;
    height: 100px;
    background: orange;
}

.grow {
    flex: 1;
    height: 100px;
    background: lightgreen;
}

.box {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid black;
}

Explanation

Box 1 → Fixed width (100px)
Box 3 → Fixed width (100px)
Box 2 → flex: 1, so it grows and shrinks according to the container size.
4. Media Query (Change Box Color)
HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="square"></div>

</body>
</html>
CSS
.square {
    width: 50px;
    height: 50px;
    background-color: green;
}

/* 300px to 400px */
@media (min-width: 300px) and (max-width: 400px) {
    .square {
        background-color: red;
    }
}

/* Above 400px */
@media (min-width: 401px) {
    .square {
        background-color: blue;
    }
}
